  "Description": "Alert: Alert - Okta - Threats & Platform\nMITRE ATT&CK: Credential Access / T1110\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Security Threat Detected\" or \"<ip>|Okta Security Threat Detected\"\n\nDetects when an security threat is detected in Okta.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_security_threat_detected/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_security_threat_detected.yml",
